                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The @HouseCommerce Health Subcommittee welcomed @SecKennedy to testify before Congress on his plans to restructure and strengthen the @HHSGov.\n\nI remain committed to working alongside Secretary Kennedy to improve the quality of care for patients nationwide, eliminate the burdensome pill penalty, and ensure that New Jersey and the United States continue to lead the world in biotechnology and biopharmaceutical innovation.",
