                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, I toured JAG Physical Therapy in Warren Township, one of 13 clinics serving New Jersey's 7th District.\u00a0From seniors regaining strength to prevent falls to athletes returning from injury, JAG PT helps patients across our community rehabilitate, prevent injury, and maintain independence.\n\nOne constituent I met shared her gratitude for JAG's support after her knee surgery. She is now rebuilding strength to enjoy more time with her grandchildren.\n\nThank you, JAG PT. I will continue fighting for commonsense reforms that support physical therapy clinics and the patients they serve across New Jersey.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1759521731,
                "view_count": 789
            },
            {
