                "text": "Everyone knows a neighbor, colleague, or friend who has struggled when trying to grow their family and benefited from IVF.\n\nThank you @POTUS for your groundbreaking efforts to make IVF and infertility treatments more accessible through employer coverage and lower drug prices. This will be a life-changing step forward for so many couples who dream of having children.",
