                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congress must lead with solutions, not shutdowns.\n\nOnce the government is reopened, we must address healthcare affordability in New Jersey. \n\nI support extending the ACA premium tax credits and delivering responsible solutions that lower costs without taking coverage away from those who depend on it.",
