                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to all the seniors who joined my office's Medicare Open Enrollment Information Session at the Hopatcong Senior Center! My team answered FAQs about the enrollment process and shared resources to help constituents select the right coverage for them in 2026.\n\u00a0\nOpen enrollment is underway now through December 7th! Learn more at https://t.co/imsgqgxtP7",
