                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday I met with audiologists and speech-language pathologists from the American Speech-Language-Hearing Association. These New Jersey-based clinicians ensure that effective communication and essential care remain within reach for all patients.\n\u00a0\nOur conversation focused on strengthening access and coverage for hearing and balance services, as well as speech, language, cognitive, and swallowing care. Thank you @ASHAWeb for the great meeting!",
