                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I introduced the bipartisan HELP Copays Act alongside @RepBarragan, @RepMMM, @RepAuchincloss, @RepBrianFitz, and @RepBonnie. \n\nFor too long, health insurers and PBMs have been pocketing copay assistance without lowering patients\u2019 cost-sharing obligations. Our bill fixes that problem and will make life-saving prescription medications more affordable for patients with rare, serious, and chronic conditions.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
